<title>USA: NYNEX gets Vermont approval for merger.</title>
<headline>NYNEX gets Vermont approval for merger.</headline>
<dateline>MONTPELIER, Vt 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>NYNEX Corp said on Thursday that Vermont's Public Service Board approved its proposed merger with Bell Atlantic Corp, leaving only New York to be heard from among the seven states NYNEX serves.</p>
<p>The other six states all have either approved the merger or have not sought jurisdiction over it, NYNEX said.</p>
<p>Bell Atlantic said that because its ownership is not changing, it does not need approval for the merger from the states it serves.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
